flowchart LR
    A[Immutable source archive] --> B[Audit labels and image geometry]
    B --> C{Valid schema and box?}
    C -- no --> D[Quarantine with reason]
    C -- yes --> E[Normalize RGB image and labels]
    E --> F[Group observable duplicates]
    F --> G[Lock parent image split]
    G --> H[Train: augment and learn]
    G --> I[Validation: compare and select]
    G --> J[Test: reserved]
    H --> K[Derived ROIs inherit parent split]
    I --> K
